WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.080
Every little noise of them makes me feel sick

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.980
Suppose, you are knocked out enough to bear this hell anymore

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:18.800
Second lieutenant rally sir what is it you're after an old friend is out here captain Stan? You don't want to join them

00:00:19.359 --> 00:00:21.359
They may have a hell of a time of it

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:24.930
It's just what I'm hoping for sir

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:31.440
You haven't been in the army five minutes have you?

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.880
Our company commander you know. Hello, Stan !

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.980
You'll find him changed

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:46.740
He said this company throw all sorts of rotten times big strain on a man

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.600
He used to come and stay with me my sister Margaret in the holidays

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:59.900
She is beautiful. She waiting for me. I don't want to see how shot I am

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.780
We won't last five minutes if the Germans attack. You'll to stay where you are for as long as you can

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:10.620
When's that expected? Day after tomorrow.

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:19.380
This waiting is like being summoned to the headmaster, they've sent us here to die

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:28.500
All these youngsters do not realize how unlucky they are

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:34.330
Or does it matter they all feel like we do

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:40.440
I'm glad it's you and me together

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:49.720
I can't stick it any longer. You think there is still living to what a man can bear. There is a job to be done my darling

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:57.260
I mean to come through this. So we stick at it. it's the only thing that a decent man can do

